# The shop's two services run here. A slice whose name starts "shop-" is a
# part of shop.slice, so both are inside shop.slice and under its
# allowance. Being together in one group one level down is what makes them
# stand in a single line for the data disk, first come, first served, as
# programs do at a cloud's disk.
[Unit]
Description=The shop's services
Requires=lab-disks.service
After=lab-disks.service
